        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="1524-30c8-5da7-66ff">Assault 1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="45fd-0f50-e1d0-907c">To fire the acid spray place the template so that the narrow end is within 12" of the weapon and the large end is no closer to the weapon than the narrow end. The acid spray is then treated like any other template weapon.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
