        <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="45fd-0f50-e1d0-907c">A model with Flesh Hooks always strikes in Initiative order when assaulting an enemy in cover.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Heavy Venom Cannon" typeId="8e6f-7553-28c5-95a0" typeName="Weapons" hidden="false" id="c008-395f-3bd0-8b72">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="9b9e-0c24-e409-a801">36"</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Str." typeId="1ebc-896c-43de-904a">9</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="730c-47dc-fdad-3c8b">4</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="1524-30c8-5da7-66ff">Assault 1, Blast</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="45fd-0f50-e1d0-907c">Unless the target is an open-topped vehicle, any glancing or penetrating hit inflicted by a heavy venom cannon suffer an additional -1 penalty to rolls on the Vehicle Damage Chart.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Impaler Cannon" typeId="8e6f-7553-28c5-95a0" typeName="Weapons" hidden="false" id="621c-8897-92ec-6ed8">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="9b9e-0c24-e409-a801">24"</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Str." typeId="1ebc-896c-43de-904a">8</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="730c-47dc-fdad-3c8b">4</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="1524-30c8-5da7-66ff">Assault 2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="45fd-0f50-e1d0-907c">The Impaler cannon can shoot any target in range, regardless of whether there is line of sight to it or not. The target can only count the benefits of cover they are in or youching if it lies between them and the Hive Guard. Vehicles are always hit on the armour value facing the Hive Guard.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Ripper Tentacles" typeId="8e6f-7553-28c5-95a0" typeName="Weapons" hidden="false" id="5854-62b8-77e0-576e">
      <characteristics>
